<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli airstrikes and artillery shelling have hit southern Lebanese towns such as Nabatieh Heights and Mafdon villages, while an IDF spokesperson visited a Lebanese school, provoking local outrage. Hezbollah continues to expand its arsenal, as evidenced by reports of 14 interdicted arms shipments and an active supply route. Iran has ordered its Revolutionary Guards to leave Beirut strongholds, signaling a shift in regional involvement. The conflict has already caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNZnpuclR3SmtTOWFTNWphQmVaa2NuZFZVZXpYQjBKS2Jkb0NjLTZWbjlHNnJqcGh4RWQwd05qbGZfQ2V6YU14b0dMQzRhQ1JSSGw2alJlMzMyZTlNUWljU0NIeWwyS0NwS1VZb1FqN3VDV1dobzhlOVFpdU9UVjFDM0JEaTU3OGUtN2dXODcydkp5RVZSSDcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQSlAzUnAzUGpEMEFyTXI0VWFBQk5zX1U3cjVqemRCVGFTNGNoTnpjTG94X3pfUzFVQUxIU0hlWjVhN2lLZzFBNk1nWHZxclhRVmZTcmtqTmt6REt4QkR2enoydTIyUENHU21UOEVBZWRVeUx2QVFXaUdhNzdmS3FyREVmemFJWEVscmJxbHVmLVp3QVVvdTdqYjltc1o4R0wxNWdIRGZBdGIzdVdia19JTmtjMk03cW1CSWNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPQ1lxblpzTnZReE5vQS1kaWxia09NeG5hU29IdFdCUVZJa2lJZnJCVTVrVjlFUHBYcmpFRDl1VUFjXzAydWdtYlpkUVNSd3pGSU9hdVY2Tno0UC0xQTM3b05lMWt6bUR2LWN0Vllfb3A3Sko0bm1YQVBIZERCNGtLYk9maGwtUWFMdnhsS1d6QVcweWwwMHVLc04wWWV6eERYYURDR2dlX21XRThhYUZQZC16XzFVYmxfeF9R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Alma Research and Educat